      },
      "message": "test(app): pin the laid rotary contour as a cut, not a refusal\n\nThe gate of PR #3026 found two app tests that pinned the old\nhorizontal-stance refusal of Rotary Contour. Issue #3000 removes that\nrefusal on purpose, so each test now pins the new result:\n\n- operations: the twin test keeps the standing-bar refusal of Rotary\n  Parallel. A new test cuts the laid twin and requires status Ok, zero\n  blocking warnings, radial poses about X, ball centers inside the\n  station window and rings at several stations.\n- setup_align_multiaxis: the as-modelled Rotary Contour must cut about\n  X with radial poses, and differ from the turned path.\n\nThe decision record gives the reason and the dropped options.\n\nRefs #3000\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
