      "message": "test(app): expect the as-modelled rotary contour about Y\n\nunturn_xz maps (x, y, z) to (y, z, x), so the as-modelled bar axis is\nworld Y, not X. The batch gate measured the fitted axis [0, 1, 0]. The\nflat-stance branch of #3000 takes any horizontal axis, so the modelled\ncase cuts about Y. The test now names Y; the radial-pose and differs\nchecks stay as they are.\n\nRefs #3000\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
